  <!-- EN: collectivist -->
  <Collectivist.label>ﻲﻋﺎﻤﺟ</Collectivist.label>
  <!-- EN: Each person is part of a greater whole. People should work to play their part and help the group. -->
  <Collectivist.description>ﻰﻠﻋ .ﻢﻈﻋﺃ ﻞﻛ ﻦﻣ ﺀﺰﺟ ﺺﺨﺷ ﻞﻛ\nﻢﻫﺭﻭﺩ ﺀﺍﺩﻷ ﺍﻮﻠﻤﻌﻳ ﻥﺃ ﺱﺎﻨﻟﺍ\n.ﺔﻋﻮﻤﺠﻤﻟﺍ ﺓﺪﻋﺎﺴﻣﻭ</Collectivist.description>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>creation(tag=meme_Collectivist)        ->[deity0_name] made all men and women from a great mold, and those that deviated [deity0_pronoun] threw into fire so the believers could live in harmony.</li>
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_Collectivist)  ->[deity0_name] said to all, "No one of you stands above the whole. Work together or perish together."</li>
    <li>intro(tag=meme_Collectivist)           ->The people of the [place_summary] [place_name] worked together in harmony, and built a great [altarName] to honor [deity0_name], who taught them the true value of [memeConcept].</li>
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_Collectivist)        ->The [foeLeader] could not abide the family of [memberNamePlural], and sent [foeLeader_possessive] [foeSoldiers] to the [place_community] to divide them against each other.</li>
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_Collectivist)     ->A [place_job] named [founderName] threw [founder_objective]self into a fire to protest the [foeLeader], but the [memberNamePlural] pulled [founder_objective] out and made [founder_objective] their leader because of [founder_possessive] devotion to the group.</li>
    <li>victory(tag=meme_Collectivist)         ->[founderName]'s actions united the people. They marched in lockstep towards the home of the [foeLeader]. Those in the front allowed themselves to be killed by the [foeSoldiers], but the whole could not be stopped, and they captured the [foeLeader].</li>
    <li>setup(tag=meme_Collectivist)           ->In a world of every man for himself, [founderName] began a new family of strangers, bringing many different people together.</li>
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_Collectivist)    ->Some of the false believers tried to break the rules and decide their own paths. [founderName] punished them severely.</li>
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_Collectivist)     ->The [place_job] stopped contributing but kept eating from the common store. I killed him with a [place_personalWeapon]. The people were shocked, but I explained that</li>
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_Collectivist)              ->my death, and yours, will mean nothing, as long as our people go on</li>
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_Collectivist) ->If I die teaching the universe this, it will be my greatest triumph.</li>
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_Collectivist)    ->The archotechs are all aspects of one supermind.</li>
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_Collectivist)     ->The archotechs have no interest in judging us one by one. They await a single people who can demonstrate our worthiness by acting morally as one.</li>
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_Collectivist) ->[inTheEnd], the archotechs will depart when they find a people who present themselves as worthy partners to the machine god-consciousness.</li>
    <li>animistFact(tag=meme_Collectivist)     ->Every spirit is simply an aspect of all the others, and those that try to stand alone are fall quickly.</li>
  -->
  <Collectivist.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
    <li>creation(tag=meme_Collectivist)        -&gt;ﻦﻣ ﺀﺎﺴﻨﻟﺍﻭ ﻝﺎﺟﺮﻟﺍ ﻊﻴﻤﺟ [deity0_name] ﻊﻨﺻ\nﻦﻳﺬﻟﺍ ﻚﺌﻟﻭﺃﻭ ،ﻢﻴﻈﻋ ﺐﻟﺎﻗ\nﺎﻴﺤﻴﻟ ﺭﺎﻨﻟﺍ ﻲﻓ [deity0_pronoun] ﻢﻬﻓﺬﻗ ﺍﻮﻓﺮﺤﻧﺍ\n.ﻡﺎﺋﻭ ﻲﻓ ﻥﻮﻨﻣﺆﻤﻟﺍ</li>
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_Collectivist)  -&gt;ﻕﻮﻓ ﻢﻜﻨﻣ ﺪﺣﺃ ﻻ" :ﻊﻴﻤﺠﻠﻟ [deity0_name] ﻝﺎﻗ\nﺍﻮﻜﻠﻫﺍ ﻭﺃ ًﺎﻌﻣ ﺍﻮﻠﻤﻋﺍ .ﻞﻜﻟﺍ\n".ًﺎﻌﻣ</li>
    <li>intro(tag=meme_Collectivist)           -&gt;،ﻡﺎﺋﻭ ﻲﻓ ًﺎﻌﻣ [place_summary] [place_name] ﻞﻫﺃ ﻞﻤﻋ\nﻱﺬﻟﺍ ،[deity0_name] ﻢﻳﺮﻜﺘﻟ ًﺎﻤﻴﻈﻋ [altarName] ﺍﻮﻨﺑﻭ\n.[memeConcept]ـﻟ ﺔﻴﻘﻴﻘﺤﻟﺍ ﺔﻤﻴﻘﻟﺍ ﻢﻬﻤﻠﻋ</li>
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_Collectivist)        -&gt;ﻞﺳﺭﺃﻭ ،[memberNamePlural] ﺔﻠﺋﺎﻋ ﻞﻤﺤﺗ [foeLeader] ﻊﻄﺘﺴﻳ ﻢﻟ\n.ﻢﻬﻀﻌﺑ ﺪﺿ ﻢﻬﻗﺮﻔﻴﻟ [place_community] ﻰﻟﺇ [foeSoldiers] [foeLeader_possessive]</li>
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_Collectivist)     -&gt;ﺭﺎﻨﻟﺍ ﻲﻓ [founder_objective]ﺲﻔﻧ[founderName] [founder_objective] ﻰﻋﺪُﻳ [place_job] ﻰﻘﻟﺃ\nﻩﻮﺟﺮﺧﺃ [memberNamePlural] ﻦﻜﻟ ،[foeLeader] ﻰﻠﻋ ًﺎﺟﺎﺠﺘﺣﺍ\n[founder_possessive]ﻲﻧﺎﻔﺗ ﺐﺒﺴﺑ ﻢﻫﺪﺋﺎﻗ ﻩﻮﻠﻌﺟﻭ\n.ﺔﻋﻮﻤﺠﻤﻠﻟ</li>
    <li>victory(tag=meme_Collectivist)         -&gt;ﻲﻓ ﺍﻭﺭﺎﺳ .ﺱﺎﻨﻟﺍ [founderName] ﻝﺎﻌﻓﺃ ﺕﺪﺣﻭ\nﻚﺌﻟﻭﺃ .[foeLeader] ﻦﻃﻮﻣ ﻮﺤﻧ ﺔﻘﺣﻼﺘﻣ ﺕﺍﻮﻄﺧ\nﻥﺄﺑ ﻢﻬﺴﻔﻧﻷ ﺍﻮﺤﻤﺳ ﺔﻣﺪﻘﻤﻟﺍ ﻲﻓ\nﻦﻜﻤﻳ ﻢﻟ ﻞﻜﻟﺍ ﻦﻜﻟ ،[foeSoldiers] ﻢﻬﻠﺘﻘﻳ\n.[foeLeader] ﺍﻭﺮﺳﺃﻭ ،ﻪﻓﺎﻘﻳﺇ</li>
    <li>setup(tag=meme_Collectivist)           -&gt;ﺃﺪﺑ ،ﻪﺴﻔﻨﻟ ﻪﻴﻓ ﺉﺮﻣﺍ ﻞﻛ ﻢﻟﺎﻋ ﻲﻓ\n،ﺀﺎﺑﺮﻐﻟﺍ ﻦﻣ ﺓﺪﻳﺪﺟ ﺔﻠﺋﺎﻋ [founderName]\n.ًﺎﻌﻣ ﺱﺎﻨﻟﺍ ﻦﻣ ﺪﻳﺪﻌﻟﺍ ًﺎﻌﻣﺎﺟ</li>
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_Collectivist)    -&gt;ﺮﺴﻛ ﻦﻴﻔﺋﺍﺰﻟﺍ ﻦﻴﻨﻣﺆﻤﻟﺍ ﺾﻌﺑ ﻝﻭﺎﺣ\n.ﺔﺻﺎﺨﻟﺍ ﻢﻬﻗﺮﻃ ﺮﻳﺮﻘﺗﻭ ﺪﻋﺍﻮﻘﻟﺍ\n.ﺓﺪﺸﺑ [founderName] ﻢﻬﺒﻗﺎﻋ</li>
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_Collectivist)     -&gt;ﺮﻤﺘﺳﺍ ﻪﻨﻜﻟ ﺔﻤﻫﺎﺴﻤﻟﺍ ﻦﻋ [place_job] ﻒﻗﻮﺗ\n.ﻙﺮﺘﺸﻤﻟﺍ ﻥﺰﺨﻤﻟﺍ ﻦﻣ ﻞﻛﻷﺍ ﻲﻓ\nﻦﻜﻟ ،ﺱﺎﻨﻟﺍ ﻡﺪُﺻ .[place_personalWeapon]ـﺑ ﻪﺘﻠﺘﻗ\nﻥﺃ ﺖﺣﺮﺷ</li>
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_Collectivist)              -&gt;،ًﺎﺌﻴﺷ ﻲﻨﻌﻳ ﻦﻟ ،ﻚﺗﻮﻣﻭ ،ﻲﺗﻮﻣ\nﺎﻨﺒﻌﺷ ﺮﻤﺘﺴﻳ ﺎﻤﻟﺎﻃ</li>
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_Collectivist) -&gt;،ﺍﺬﻫ ﻥﻮﻜﻟﺍ ﻢﻠﻋﺃ ﺎﻧﺃﻭ ﺖﻣ ﺍﺫﺇ\n.ﻲﻟ ﺭﺎﺼﺘﻧﺍ ﻢﻈﻋﺃ ﻥﻮﻜﻴﺴﻓ</li>
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_Collectivist)    -&gt;ﻞﻘﻋ ﻦﻣ ﺐﻧﺍﻮﺟ ﻢﻬﻠﻛ ﻚﻴﺗﻮﻛﺭﻷﺍ\n.ﺪﺣﺍﻭ ﻢﻈﻋﺃ</li>
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_Collectivist)     -&gt;ﻢﻜﺤﻟﺍ ﻲﻓ ﻚﻴﺗﻮﻛﺭﻸﻟ ﺔﺤﻠﺼﻣ ﻻ\nﻢﻬﻧﺇ .ًﺍﺩﺮﻓ ًﺍﺩﺮﻓ ﺎﻨﻴﻠﻋ\nﻊﻴﻄﺘﺴﻳ ًﺍﺪﺣﺍﻭ ًﺎﺒﻌﺷ ﻥﻭﺮﻈﺘﻨﻳ\nًﺎﻴﻗﻼﺧﺃ ﻙﺮﺤﺘﻟﺎﺑ ﺎﻨﺗﺭﺍﺪﺟ ﺭﺎﻬﻇﺇ\n.ﺪﺣﺍﻭ ﻥﺎﻴﻜﻛ</li>
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_Collectivist) -&gt;ﻥﻭﺪﺠﻳ ﺎﻣﺪﻨﻋ ﻚﻴﺗﻮﻛﺭﻷﺍ ﻞﺣﺮﻴﺳ ،[inTheEnd]\nﻦﻳﺮﻳﺪﺟ ﺀﺎﻛﺮﺸﻛ ﻪﺴﻔﻧ ﻡﺪﻘﻳ ًﺎﺒﻌﺷ\n.ﻲﻟﻵﺍ ﻲﻬﻟﻹﺍ ﻲﻋﻮﻟﺎﺑ</li>
    <li>animistFact(tag=meme_Collectivist)     -&gt;ﻞﻛ ﻦﻣ ﺐﻧﺎﺟ ﺩﺮﺠﻣ ﻲﻫ ﺡﻭﺭ ﻞﻛ\nﻦﻳﺬﻟﺍ ﻚﺌﻟﻭﺃﻭ ،ﻯﺮﺧﻷﺍ ﺡﺍﻭﺭﻷﺍ\nﻥﻭﻮﻬﻳ ﻢﻫﺩﺮﻔﻤﺑ ﻑﻮﻗﻮﻟﺍ ﻥﻮﻟﻭﺎﺤﻳ\n.ًﺎﻌﻳﺮﺳ</li>
 </Collectivist.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
